Datasets and model artifacts
----------------------------
The model/datasets and model/artifacts directories are ignored by Git, but
may be present in local deployment builds. They contain third-party and
gated datasets/model materials with separate terms. In particular, the
bundled GAIA README requires that validation/test data not be reshared in a
crawlable format. See LICENSE_AUDIT.md.
